<title>RUSSIA: Rouble flat at 3,623 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble flat at 3,623 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 3,623 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    Sept 5		  Sept 4</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,623		   3,623</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    3.04		    3.40</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
